### 职责对照
GET http://localhost:8027/api/interceptor/overview

### 观测执行链（可看 Filter → Interceptor → Controller）
GET http://localhost:8027/api/interceptor/chain
X-Trace-Id: demo-trace-001
X-Demo-User: alice

### 鉴权失败（无 Token）→ 401
GET http://localhost:8027/api/interceptor/secure/ping

### 鉴权成功
GET http://localhost:8027/api/interceptor/secure/ping
X-Demo-Token: demo-token-8027
X-Demo-User: bob

### 创建 Session（触发 SessionListener）
GET http://localhost:8027/api/interceptor/session
